<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.The Unaudited Standalone Financial Results (SFR) of the Company for the qtr. and six months ended Sep 30,24 have been reviewed and recommended by the AC and approved by the BOD at its meeting held on Nov 09,24.    2.The Unaudited SFR of the Co. have been prepared in accordance with Ind AS notified under Sec 133 of the Co.’s Act, 2013 read with the Companies (Ind AS Rules) 2015 and in terms of Reg 33 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015.   3.During the year ended Mar 31 2024 the Co. had completed its IPO of 15196510 equity shares of face value of Rs 10 each comprising of (i) fresh issue of 4367088 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 790 per equity share (ii) fresh issue of 69930 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 715 per equity share for employee quota (iii) an offer for sale of 10759492 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 790 per equity share. The equity shares of the Co. were listed on BSE and NSE on Dec 20,23.   Details of the IPO net proceeds are as follows   Particulars     Amount (as per offer document) (Rs lakhs)   Gross Proceeds from the fresh issue  35000   (Less) Estimated Issue related expenses   1842.50     (proportionate to Co.'s share)*   Net Proceeds    33157.50     *Issue related exps. (net of GST) amt. to Rs 1533.09 lakhs have been adjusted against securities premium as per Sec 52 of the Co.’s Act, 2013   Details of the utilisation of IPO net proceeds is summarised below (Rs Lakhs)   Particulars        Objects of the issue (as per offer document)      Utilised upto Sep 30,24       Unutilised as on Sep 30,24   Part financing of    28000         5021.19          22978.81     proposed project                   General Corporate   5157.5          5112.58                          44.92     Purposes   Total utilisation of funds 33157.50          10133.77           23023.73     Out of the Net proceeds which were unutilised as at Sep 30,24 Rs 22200.00 lakhs are temporarily invested in FD’s, Rs 632.25 lakhs is held in the Company's Monitoring Account, while the balance amount is held in the public offer account towards the Co.'s share of expenses related to Issue.   4.During the quarter ended Sep 30,24, the Company acquired 51.77% equity shares in Uniclan Healthcare Pvt Ltd (Uniclan) for a consideration aggregating to Rs 5487.92 lakhs. Upon completion of the acquisition on Sep 16, 24, Uniclan became subsidiary of the Company from that date.    5.i) Attention is drawn to the fact that the figures for the quarter and six months ended Sep 30, 23 as reported in these Unaudited SFR have been approved by the Co.'s Board of Directors but have not been subjected to review since the requirement of submission of quarterly SFR is applicable on listing of equity shares of the Co., which was from the quarter ended Dec 31,23.   ii)The results for the quarter ended Jun 30,24 and year ended Mar 31,24 were reviewed/audited by the previous statutory auditors of the Co.   6.Since the segment information as per IND AS 108 Operating segments, is provided in the Unaudited Consolidated Financial Results, the same is not provided separately in the Unaudited SFR.   7.Certain balances as at Mar 31,24 have been reclassified to conform to the classification as at Sep 30,24. Accordingly, Trade payables amounting to Rs 125.00 lakhs have been reclassified to Other current liabilities, Non-current provisions amounting to Rs 164.75 lakhs have been reclassified as Current provisions and Other non-current assets amounting to Rs 408.78 lakhs have been reclassified as Other non-current financial assets. These reclassifications are not considered material to the financial results.   8.The results will be available on the Co.'s website www.domsindia.com and also on the website of BSE www.bseindia.com and NSE www.nseindia.com, where the shares of the Co. are listed.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
